aero — a modern rewrite of XFOIL in Rust

This project contains Rust ports of algorithms from XFOIL 6.996
(https://web.mit.edu/drela/Public/web/xfoil/), in particular:

  - spline.f   (SPLIND, SEGSPL, SEVAL, DEVAL, D2VAL, CURV, SINVRT, SCALC, TRISOL)
  - naca.f     (NACA4, NACA5)
  - xgeom.f    (LEFIND, NORM, SOPPS, TCCALC, GEOPAR)
  - xfoil.f    (PANGEN, TECALC, CPCALC, CLCALC, CDCALC, COMSET, MRCL,
                MHINGE, GETXYF)
  - xpanel.f   (APCALC, NCALC, PSILIN, PSWLIN, GGCALC, QISET, XYWAKE,
                QDCALC, QWCALC, STFIND, IBLPAN, XICALC, UICALC, QVFUE,
                GAMQV, STMOVE)
  - xoper.f    (VISCAL, SPECAL, SPECCL and the ASEQ/CSEQ sequence logic)
  - xbl.f      (SETBL, IBLSYS, MRCHUE, MRCHDU, XIFSET, UPDATE, DSLIM,
                BLPINI)
  - xblsys.f   (TRCHEK2, BLSYS, TESYS, BLPRV, BLKIN, BLVAR, BLMID, BLDIF,
                TRDIF, DAMPL, DAMPL2, AXSET, HKIN, HSL, HST, CFL, CFT, HCT,
                DIL)
  - xsolve.f   (BLSOLV, GAUSS)
  - xutils.f   (ATANC)

